.DS_Store

# Eval evidence is tracked on purpose: report-evals.py builds the published tables
# from aggregate-result.json, so a clone has to carry it or the numbers are unverifiable
# assertions. device-claims was ignored wholesale, which meant the stamp check had
# nothing to check for the one suite carrying the headline figure.
# The HTML viewer beside it is regenerable and large, so new ones stay out.
*/evals/results/*/report.html
